1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 3=

8
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,600
No.

9
00:00:49,759 --> 00:00:50,899
It must be that scoundrel.

10
00:00:51,299 --> 00:00:52,619
He tampered with the soup.

11
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,560
That accursed villain.

12
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,359
It worked.

13
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:20,439
Bro, these women are quite something.

14
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,140
This one's mine.

15
00:01:22,859 --> 00:01:23,859
I'll take these two.

16
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,680
Go.

17
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:31,780
(I haven't completed my tribulation.)

18
00:01:32,116 --> 00:01:33,480
(Using my primordial spirit power)

19
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,280
(will both draw heavenly thunder)

20
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:37,480
(and get sensed by that woman.)

21
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,159
(What do I do?)

22
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,560
This one's not bad either.

23
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:04,040
You two carry on.

24
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:15,360
They're out cold like dead fish.

25
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,719
You're just in time.

26
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,620
I prefer the ones who scream.

27
00:02:22,759 --> 00:02:23,759
Don't worry.

28
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:27,419
None of you are getting away.

29
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:34,319
Help!

30
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,900
Help!

31
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,060
Help!

32
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,819
- Help!
- (So be it.)

33
00:02:41,819 --> 00:02:43,699
- (I'd rather face the heavenly thunder)
- Help!

34
00:02:43,699 --> 00:02:44,979
(and the risk of being sensed)

35
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,879
(than not protect my women.)

36
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:51,800
It's his primordial spirit aura.

37
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:53,699
He's still alive?

38
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:06,939
Then I'll find him and kill him again.

39
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:20,900
Zhao Laizi?

40
00:03:21,539 --> 00:03:22,800
Weren't you tied up?

41
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,439
Messing with my women,

42
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,919
have you decided how you want to die?

43
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:32,232
(Affection)

44
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:33,879
Drop the act.

45
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,300
Kill him.

46
00:03:36,659 --> 00:03:37,740
Bone Shatter.

47
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,139
Inferno Scorch.

48
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,080
We're fine.

49
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,080
We're fine.

50
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,240
You scared me.

51
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,139
Zhao Laizi, you're quite a bluffer.

52
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:53,500
Get him!

53
00:03:54,975 --> 00:03:56,578
(Affection)

54
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:05,979
(Affection)
Heavens, is he an immortal?

55
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,400
Stay inside.

56
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:19,216
(Affection)

57
00:04:36,288 --> 00:04:37,616
(Affection)

58
00:04:44,886 --> 00:04:45,976
(Affection)

59
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,540
(Affection)
Oh, my, my husband

60
00:04:54,939 --> 00:04:56,759
is actually like an immortal.

61
00:04:57,579 --> 00:04:58,899
Such a handsome man

62
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,519
is my husband.

63
00:05:03,459 --> 00:05:04,680
I, Su Wan'er...

64
00:05:05,579 --> 00:05:07,660
I am finally going to make it big.

65
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:10,379
(Affection)

66
00:05:10,379 --> 00:05:12,180
I can't let the other three find out.

67
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:16,259
My husband belongs to me alone.

68
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,259
I almost got a lock on him.

69
00:05:26,579 --> 00:05:28,939
But you can't run.

70
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:35,180
Dong.

71
00:05:39,139 --> 00:05:40,139
Dong,

72
00:05:40,139 --> 00:05:41,300
are you an immortal?

73
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:43,800
Don't act familiar.

74
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,519
I'm nothing but a lowlife.

75
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:49,560
How could I ever be worthy of
a high-and-mighty phoenix like you?

76
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:50,860
Besides,

77
00:05:51,259 --> 00:05:52,519
as a toad,

78
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:54,360
I don't lust after a swan like you.

79
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:58,180
Dong, someone who appears
as an immortal like you

80
00:05:58,339 --> 00:06:01,040
shouldn't hold a grudge
against a little woman like me.

81
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:04,019
I know I was wrong.

82
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,639
From now on, I will do whatever you say.

83
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:13,439
We're husband and wife, after all.

84
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,319
We have it in writing.

85
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:18,160
Forget it. I can't be bothered to argue.

86
00:06:18,579 --> 00:06:19,579
You four take the house.

87
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:20,860
I'll sleep in the shed.

88
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,899
We'll worry about food in the morning.

89
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,560
Glad it was only three
heavenly thunder strikes.

90
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,600
I'll veil my immortal aura
with mortal qi

91
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:48,339
and suppress my soul's pulse.

92
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,120
Dong.

93
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:14,860
Su Wan'er?

94
00:07:16,259 --> 00:07:17,459
What are you doing here?

95
00:07:18,579 --> 00:07:22,699
I'm here to share your bed, naturally.

96
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,819
Wherever you'll sleep,

97
00:07:25,259 --> 00:07:27,040
I will sleep there too.

98
00:07:33,232 --> 00:07:34,912
(Affection)

99
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:36,959
(Affection reached 90?)

100
00:07:37,379 --> 00:07:40,019
(Dual cultivation now
can rapidly boost cultivation.)

101
00:07:41,779 --> 00:07:43,819
Are you sure? No regrets?

102
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:04,391
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

103
00:08:04,391 --> 00:08:07,178
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

104
00:08:07,754 --> 00:08:09,916
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

105
00:08:09,916 --> 00:08:12,762
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

106
00:08:12,762 --> 00:08:16,040
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

107
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,674
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

108
00:08:17,674 --> 00:08:19,738
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

109
00:08:19,738 --> 00:08:21,274
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

110
00:08:21,274 --> 00:08:24,056
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

111
00:08:24,505 --> 00:08:26,410
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

112
00:08:26,410 --> 00:08:32,441
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

113
00:08:33,023 --> 00:08:36,906
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

114
00:08:36,906 --> 00:08:40,131
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

115
00:08:40,643 --> 00:08:43,242
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

116
00:08:43,242 --> 00:08:48,370
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

117
00:08:48,370 --> 00:08:51,898
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

118
00:08:51,898 --> 00:08:55,606
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

119
00:08:55,606 --> 00:08:57,498
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

120
00:08:57,498 --> 00:08:59,575
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

121
00:08:59,575 --> 00:09:02,106
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

122
00:09:02,106 --> 00:09:06,143
♪You met the most precious person♪

123
00:09:07,811 --> 00:09:09,674
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

124
00:09:09,674 --> 00:09:12,193
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

125
00:09:12,193 --> 00:09:13,642
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

126
00:09:13,642 --> 00:09:15,944
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

127
00:09:15,944 --> 00:09:17,914
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

128
00:09:17,914 --> 00:09:22,324
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

129
00:09:22,324 --> 00:09:23,866
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

130
00:09:23,866 --> 00:09:25,776
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

131
00:09:25,776 --> 00:09:29,050
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

132
00:09:29,050 --> 00:09:32,371
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

133
00:09:32,371 --> 00:09:34,106
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

134
00:09:34,106 --> 00:09:38,730
♪Just catch your breath first♪

135
00:09:38,730 --> 00:09:42,480
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

136
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:45,858
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

137
00:09:46,232 --> 00:09:48,202
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

138
00:09:48,202 --> 00:09:53,949
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

139
00:09:53,949 --> 00:09:57,465
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

140
00:09:57,465 --> 00:09:59,034
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

141
00:09:59,034 --> 00:10:01,344
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

142
00:10:01,344 --> 00:10:03,082
♪From laughter to devotion♪

143
00:10:03,082 --> 00:10:05,138
♪From falling to innocence♪

144
00:10:05,138 --> 00:10:06,986
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

145
00:10:06,986 --> 00:10:13,656
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
